message: "If you use this architecture or its documentation, please cite it."
title: "Web3 Identity SEO: Structured Data for ENS Identity Pages"
abstract: >-
  An open-source architecture and documentation set for making ENS-based
  identities understandable to search engines as named entities: Schema.org
  Person-first entity graphs, ProfilePage markup, proof-of-personhood
  credentials, cross-platform sameAs consistency, and indexing hygiene.
  Reference implementation: ookyet.eth.
